使诣阙奉藩称臣。上以问朗陵侯臧宫。宫曰：「匈奴饥疫分争，臣愿得五千骑以立功。」帝笑曰：「常胜之家，难与虑敌，吾方自思之。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"迨和帝之世，窦宪出塞五千里，大破北匈奴，北单于逃亡，其余...","context_before":"","source_end_index":15,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ac1aef17-3cf3-4e25-86b8-b320184e2b4b","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"南单于降汉，光武置之西河塞内，"}],"title":"二 明华夷之防"}],"id":3441,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"94e0c0b5-db0e-11ef-92bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二十四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二十四年","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94e0c072-db0e-11ef-a1c7-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（戊申、四八）","year_int":48},"message":"success","success":true}